      <title>Medicare不付长期护理费，误解或致退休者自掏数万美元</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/Medicare%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%98%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E6%8A%A4%E7%90%86%E8%B4%B9%E8%AF%AF%E8%A7%A3%E6%88%96%E8%87%B4%E9%80%80%E4%BC%91%E8%80%85%E8%87%AA%E6%8E%8F%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83/</link>
